[75.661601, "o", "\u001b[13d \u001b[38:2:128:128:128m\u001b[1m\u001b[3mPlanning instrumentation probes and hypotheses\u001b(B\u001b[m                                                                         \u001b[15;1H Execution path: \u001b[38:2:138:190:183mcart.test.mjs\u001b[39m calls \u001b[38:2:138:190:183mtotalWithTax(1001, 825)\u001b[39m in \u001b[38:2:138:190:183mcart.mjs\u001b[39m, which computes the taxed cent value and       \u001b[16;1H applies \u001b[38:2:138:190:183mMath.floor\u001b[39m.                                                                                                    \u001b[17;1H                                                                                                                        \u001b[18;1H Competing hypotheses:                                                                                                  \u001b[19;1H \u001b[38:2:138:190:183m1. \u001b[39mThe implementation uses downward rounding (\u001b[38:2:138:190:183mMath.floor\u001b[39m) instead of nearest-cent rounding.         \u001b[K"]
[75.662188, "o", "                   \u001b[20;1H \u001b[38:2:138:190:183m2. \u001b[39mFloating-point representation puts the raw result unexpectedly below the intended threshold.                        \u001b[21;1H \u001b[38:2:138:190:183m3. \u001b[39mBasis points are converted with the wrong denominator or interpreted as another unit.                               \u001b[22;1H \u001b[38:2:138:190:183m4. \u001b[39mInputs arrive with unexpected types/values, causing coercion.                                                       \u001b[23;1H \u001b[38:2:138:190:183m5. \u001b[39mRounding occurs at the wrong stage (tax versus final total).                                                        \u001b[24;1H                                                                                                                        \u001b[25;1H I\u001b[K’ll add one append-only probe capturing inputs, types, intermediate values, and competing rounding outcomes in        \u001b[26;1H \u001b[38:2:138:190:183m/tmp/pi-debug-cart.log\u001b[39m.                    \u001b[K                                                                "]
